{"nodes":[{"id":"aab1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# Linux日志与时间\n\n**模块说明**：rsyslog/journald + NTP/chronyd\n\n— 1 个笔记 —","x":-110,"y":-200,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"7"},{"id":"aab1c1d1e1f10002","type":"file","file":"Linux日志与时间.md","x":-130,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"aab1c1d1e1f10003","type":"text","text":"Linux日志与时间.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型\n• §1 Linux 日志系统全景\n• §2 /var/log 目录\n• §3 rsyslog.conf\n• §4 facility 8 种\n• §5 priority 8 级\n• §6 规则语法\n• §7 自定义 facility + logger\n• §8 rsyslog 远程日志\n• §9 journald 是什么\n• §10 journald.conf\n• §11 Storage= 三种\n• §12 journalctl 用法\n• §13 服务故障 5 案例\n• §14 date\n• §15 hwclock\n• §16 timedatectl\n• §17 tzselect\n• §18 chronyd\n• §19 chronyc sources\n• §20 NTP 配置实战\n• §21 速查表\n• §22 易错点\n• §23 面试追问\n• §24 链路","x":200,"y":-200,"width":380,"height":600}],"edges":[{"id":"eab1c1d1e1f10001","fromNode":"aab1c1d1e1f10001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aab1c1d1e1f10002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"eab1c1d1e1f10002","fromNode":"aab1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"aab1c1d1e1f10003","toSide":"left"}]}
